WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 1]

01:40.020 --> 01:43.420
[Somewhere in the Distant Seas Realm]

01:54.760 --> 01:55.620
Let the hunt

01:56.600 --> 01:57.490
begin.

02:16.660 --> 02:17.980
[Han Li, Core Formation Mid-Stage]

02:18.000 --> 02:19.010
A Tier Six Demon Beast, huh?

02:38.670 --> 02:39.820
Take this!

02:51.040 --> 02:52.330
You're pretty good.

03:09.480 --> 03:10.100
Again!

03:27.840 --> 03:28.740
Four Symbols: Black Tortoise Formation!

03:28.840 --> 03:29.290
Rise!

03:31.920 --> 03:32.410
Take this.

03:44.680 --> 03:45.540
Looks pretty decent.

03:48.150 --> 03:49.260
They say...

03:49.260 --> 03:50.030
[200 years ago]

03:50.030 --> 03:51.540
in the mountains time stands still,

03:52.190 --> 03:53.660
while a thousand years pass in the mortal world.

03:53.660 --> 03:54.960
[Wuligou Village, Qingniu Town, Jing Prefecture, Yue Kingdom, Tiannan Continent]

03:54.960 --> 03:55.940
My story

03:56.630 --> 03:58.610
starts from 200 years ago.

03:59.150 --> 03:59.660
Blockhead!

03:59.750 --> 04:00.820
Blockhead, wake up.

04:01.000 --> 04:02.940
[Han Xiaomei]
Mother made some flatbreads for you.

04:05.750 --> 04:06.450
Flatbreads?

04:06.870 --> 04:07.850
Where did she get the flour?

04:08.030 --> 04:09.500
Father borrowed flour from Sixth Uncle, and Madam Zheng.

04:09.630 --> 04:10.940
I don't think

04:11.150 --> 04:12.170
anyone will believe me,

04:12.870 --> 04:14.660
but I stepped into the world of cultivation

04:15.030 --> 04:16.260
because of a flatbread

04:16.630 --> 04:17.450
and three bowls of flour.

04:17.690 --> 04:18.960
- Here's a huge one. - Here.

04:19.070 --> 04:20.910
The Han family of Wuligou Village, Qingniu Town...

04:21.020 --> 04:21.710
[Father of Han Li]

04:21.710 --> 04:23.380
had been farmers for generations.

04:24.240 --> 04:26.780
Only my third uncle made it into the Seven Mysteries Sect as an outer disciple.

04:27.470 --> 04:29.430
He became the most respected man in the village.

04:29.430 --> 04:30.000
[Grandfather of Han Li]

04:30.000 --> 04:31.010
Didn't you and Mr. Zhang come up with

04:31.030 --> 04:32.010
an excellent name for Blockhead?

04:32.080 --> 04:34.260
For a village boy like me,

04:35.190 --> 04:36.260
getting into the Seven Mysteries Sect

04:36.680 --> 04:38.940
was my only chance at changing my family's destiny.

04:39.080 --> 04:39.940
Han Li?

04:40.120 --> 04:41.100
That's right. Han Li.

04:41.310 --> 04:42.610
This chubby boy

04:42.960 --> 04:43.940
is Zhang Tie.

04:44.630 --> 04:46.940
He's my best friend in the village.

04:47.360 --> 04:48.220
[Zhang Tie]
Enjoying some flatbreads?

04:49.560 --> 04:50.220
I have some too.

04:50.340 --> 04:51.610
- You too? - You too?

04:51.610 --> 04:52.000
Not bad at all.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.940
My father made these for me after borrowing three bowls of flour from Uncle Niu.

04:54.280 --> 04:55.410
He forbade me from eating them now.

04:55.420 --> 04:56.500
According to the village rules,

04:57.240 --> 04:58.220
before setting out on a long journey

04:58.430 --> 04:59.690
or doing something important,

04:59.840 --> 05:01.450
we always eat white flour flatbreads.

05:01.450 --> 05:02.190
[Mother of Han Li]

05:02.190 --> 05:03.540
Even if it means we have to borrow the flour.

05:03.540 --> 05:04.760
If Blockhead actually makes it,

05:04.960 --> 05:06.410
- we don't need to return the flour. - However,

05:06.910 --> 05:08.360
- we must always return... - You can eat first.

05:08.400 --> 05:09.410
the things we borrowed.

05:10.030 --> 05:10.500
That's also

05:10.910 --> 05:11.850
one of the rules.

05:14.840 --> 05:15.820
Back then, I thought to myself

05:16.560 --> 05:17.730
that I must get into the Seven Mysteries Sect...

05:17.730 --> 05:18.840
My brother has a new name now.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.260
- to return the flour - What's his new name?

05:20.800 --> 05:22.130
- and for the sake of all these people here. - Han Li.

05:22.150 --> 05:23.660
Li, as in erecting a tombstone?

05:24.630 --> 05:26.450
Touch wood. Don't you say that again.

05:26.520 --> 05:27.660
[Third Uncle of Han Li]
For Han Li,

05:27.800 --> 05:29.500
the character, Li, means standing upright between Heaven and Earth.

05:30.000 --> 05:32.220
Han Li...

05:32.470 --> 05:33.220
By the way,

05:34.000 --> 05:35.010
I have an official name now.

05:35.630 --> 05:36.780
I'm no longer Blockhead.

05:37.680 --> 05:38.610
My name is Han Li.

05:39.680 --> 05:41.100
Li, as in standing upright between Heaven and Earth.

05:44.820 --> 05:46.150
[Boneforge Cliff, Seven Mysteries Sect]

05:46.150 --> 05:47.940
This year's entrance exam is a hike.

05:48.400 --> 05:50.380
The first seven participants who reach the peak will join the sect.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.540
The rest will go home.

05:58.870 --> 05:59.250
Stop.

06:00.270 --> 06:00.810
That's enough.

06:01.430 --> 06:02.700
We already have the top seven participants here.

06:03.240 --> 06:04.580
The rest of you

06:05.120 --> 06:05.900
are too late.

06:05.900 --> 06:06.870
[Li Feiyu, Outer Blade Hall]

06:06.870 --> 06:07.460
Go back.

06:08.390 --> 06:09.020
We failed?

06:09.560 --> 06:10.490
How can I return the flour, then?

06:10.510 --> 06:11.930
Senior, you can't do this to us!

06:13.360 --> 06:13.730
Zhang Tie!

06:13.950 --> 06:14.930
You shouldn't have eaten that much.

06:15.560 --> 06:16.220
Do you know something?

06:16.560 --> 06:17.730
You wouldn't have come in ninth place

06:18.270 --> 06:19.850
if you had eaten less in the first place.

06:21.480 --> 06:22.220
I...

06:22.800 --> 06:23.730
So that makes me number eight, then.

06:24.600 --> 06:25.170
Senior!

06:27.480 --> 06:27.780
Tie!

06:27.830 --> 06:28.340
Putting on an act now?

06:28.390 --> 06:28.780
What's wrong?

06:28.950 --> 06:30.220
He's in pain! It's not an act!

06:30.920 --> 06:31.410
Tie!

06:31.600 --> 06:32.290
Are you okay?

06:32.480 --> 06:33.100
Where does it hurt?

06:33.870 --> 06:34.580
Physician Mo?

06:39.680 --> 06:40.250
Han Li!

06:45.120 --> 06:46.170
Just look at him.

06:46.190 --> 06:48.020
He had too many flatbreads right before the hike.

06:48.390 --> 06:49.410
He had three, you know.

06:49.560 --> 06:51.340
[Physician Mo]
He was hiking out in the cold as well.

06:51.360 --> 06:52.610
Does he have a death wish?

07:02.830 --> 07:03.610
You're fine now.

07:04.040 --> 07:05.140
Kid, you're lucky.

07:05.310 --> 07:06.700
Physician Mo is the savior

07:06.750 --> 07:08.220
of Sect Leader Wang.

07:08.510 --> 07:09.220
He's known as a divine healer.

07:09.750 --> 07:10.730
You'd better thank him.

07:10.920 --> 07:11.580
Thank you, Physician Mo!

07:11.830 --> 07:12.780
Thank you for saving me!

07:13.120 --> 07:13.810
Thank you, Physician Mo!

07:13.870 --> 07:14.810
Physician Mo.

07:15.310 --> 07:16.980
Are you here to select those who failed the trial?

07:17.310 --> 07:18.900
You're asking the obvious here.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.490
What do you think about them?

07:24.390 --> 07:25.370
I'll take these two.

07:28.160 --> 07:28.900
Come with me.

07:42.060 --> 07:44.540
[Shenshou Valley]

07:49.950 --> 07:51.020
This place is gorgeous.

07:54.160 --> 07:56.540
This is Shenshou Valley.

07:56.800 --> 07:59.580
Sect Leader Wang of Seven Mysteries Sect

07:59.720 --> 08:01.410
granted it to me as a special gift.

08:02.000 --> 08:03.930
I saved his life back then.

08:05.990 --> 08:06.770
Blockhead.

08:07.310 --> 08:08.810
I suppose this is our home now.

08:10.950 --> 08:13.050
That'll depend on what you two will do.

08:33.190 --> 08:34.700
Do you guys recognize the saying

08:34.920 --> 08:35.810
on the wall?

08:36.020 --> 08:41.220
[If I may meet one destined, then my long wait shall not be in vain.]

08:41.750 --> 08:42.610
We don't.

08:43.660 --> 08:47.870
[The heavenly Dao is yours, so long as you stand firm.]

08:47.870 --> 08:48.700
Are you guys illiterate?

08:49.160 --> 08:49.810
Yeah.

08:51.070 --> 08:52.490
What do you guys know, then?

08:53.190 --> 08:53.980
Master, we know how to grow crops.

08:54.190 --> 08:55.220
Don't call me Master.

08:55.240 --> 08:56.930
I haven't decided to take you guys as my disciples yet.

08:57.390 --> 08:59.020
Whether or not you two can remain here

08:59.630 --> 09:01.460
will depend on your performance.

09:09.310 --> 09:10.170
Sit down.

09:18.270 --> 09:19.220
Silly kids.

09:19.480 --> 09:22.020
There's no such thing as a free lunch in the world.

09:22.800 --> 09:24.980
That's a three-legged stool.

09:25.240 --> 09:27.370
If you wish to serve me,

09:27.630 --> 09:30.020
you have to keep your wits about you.

09:37.240 --> 09:38.100
What smell is that?

09:46.600 --> 09:47.580
Have you guys ever taken a bath before?

10:08.150 --> 10:08.820
Han Li.

10:09.240 --> 10:09.980
Why do I

10:10.720 --> 10:11.730
feel giddy?

10:16.080 --> 10:17.060
What's wrong with the water...

10:52.150 --> 10:52.650
Zhang Tie?

10:52.880 --> 10:53.500
Wake up.

10:53.670 --> 10:54.260
Wake up.

10:59.280 --> 11:00.770
You guys are young indeed.

11:00.790 --> 11:01.900
You regained consciousness already.

11:02.640 --> 11:03.410
What have you

11:03.880 --> 11:04.620
put in the water?

11:04.750 --> 11:05.900
Divine Grass Dew.

11:06.280 --> 11:07.180
It acts as a deodorant.

11:07.560 --> 11:08.820
You guys can take a sniff.

11:09.470 --> 11:10.260
See if you still smell.

11:13.920 --> 11:16.130
The stench on you two

11:17.320 --> 11:18.330
wasn't sweat.

11:18.920 --> 11:19.940
You guys just reeked.

11:20.200 --> 11:21.980
You two reeked of mortal stench.

11:23.120 --> 11:24.900
Mortal stench?

11:25.310 --> 11:27.100
Mortals consume grains.

11:27.280 --> 11:28.820
They cannot absorb the essence of Heaven and Earth.

11:28.920 --> 11:30.930
Instead, they gather all the impurities in their bodies.

11:31.070 --> 11:32.620
Of course they stink.

11:33.400 --> 11:34.450
Don't you two

11:34.450 --> 11:35.820
feel any different?

11:38.070 --> 11:39.980
Don't you guys feel spirited and refreshed?

11:41.840 --> 11:42.380
Blockhead.

11:43.400 --> 11:44.620
I do think I smell nice now.

11:44.760 --> 11:45.820
My head doesn't feel heavy anymore.

11:48.070 --> 11:49.570
I suppose I feel much more better now.

12:00.280 --> 12:02.260
Brat, I could tell that you came with a motive in mind

12:02.310 --> 12:04.260
at first glance.

12:05.200 --> 12:06.460
Was it that obvious?

12:07.790 --> 12:09.350
I couldn't care less about

12:09.360 --> 12:10.260
that little motive of yours.

12:10.920 --> 12:12.740
I can save you or destroy you

12:13.200 --> 12:14.930
with just a lift of my fingers.

12:17.560 --> 12:18.850
Want to give it a try?

12:24.510 --> 12:25.100
No.

12:25.480 --> 12:26.540
He'll chase me away if I keep this up.

12:32.030 --> 12:33.260
Physician Mo, thank you for taking us in.

12:33.470 --> 12:34.690
You're our savior.

12:34.870 --> 12:36.340
I promise, we'll do as you say.

12:36.520 --> 12:37.570
We won't upset you.

12:42.560 --> 12:43.610
Don't be scared.

12:44.840 --> 12:45.940
I intimidated you guys

12:46.910 --> 12:48.450
so that you two

12:48.630 --> 12:49.610
would know

12:49.840 --> 12:51.890
who calls the shots here.

12:54.470 --> 12:56.410
There are only three rules here.

12:57.000 --> 12:57.890
First rule,

12:58.840 --> 13:00.540
you must be mindful of every matter

13:00.630 --> 13:02.010
in this valley.

13:05.960 --> 13:06.730
Second rule,

13:07.000 --> 13:09.060
do not make contact with those fools outside.

13:09.430 --> 13:10.290
Third rule,

13:12.430 --> 13:14.100
and the most important rule,

13:15.430 --> 13:17.890
I'll teach you guys a mantra.

13:19.190 --> 13:21.340
You guys have to memorize it and practice it constantly.

13:21.800 --> 13:23.410
I'm serious.

13:24.150 --> 13:25.340
If you cannot follow these three rules,

13:25.400 --> 13:26.540
you'd better scram

13:26.750 --> 13:28.500
and don't waste my time.

13:29.120 --> 13:29.890
I'll remember that.

13:32.240 --> 13:34.220
You guys nodded without thinking, huh?

13:34.910 --> 13:35.820
Very good.

13:36.240 --> 13:37.460
I'll see

13:37.600 --> 13:39.130
how you guys will keep your promise.

14:00.000 --> 14:00.730
There are only three of us,

14:00.960 --> 14:02.060
but we have six dishes here.

14:11.390 --> 14:12.220
Physician Mo.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.250
I'm not hungry.

14:16.550 --> 14:17.820
You guys can go ahead.

14:18.480 --> 14:19.580
How could we do this?

14:20.240 --> 14:21.770
Of course you must eat before us.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.850
Sit down.

14:34.750 --> 14:35.730
Take your chopsticks.

14:37.960 --> 14:38.820
Eat up.

14:39.600 --> 14:41.180
From tomorrow onward,

14:41.630 --> 14:43.820
you two will serve me.

14:44.480 --> 14:46.850
Do not make me look after you two again.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.250
What meat is this?

14:48.550 --> 14:49.300
It tastes so nice.

14:49.790 --> 14:50.770
That's not meat.

14:51.240 --> 14:52.220
It's Chun root.

14:52.720 --> 14:53.300
What's that?

14:53.390 --> 14:54.220
Is it the root of a tree?

14:54.630 --> 14:56.770
Chun wood has a firm and upright structure.

14:57.670 --> 14:58.980
In traditional medicine, it is considered beneficial

14:59.200 --> 15:00.890
for hair and skin.

15:01.440 --> 15:02.730
After it's harvested,

15:03.000 --> 15:04.730
mix with raw scallions and steam thoroughly.

15:05.200 --> 15:06.370
After steaming for half a day,

15:07.120 --> 15:08.420
saw it into fine shreds,

15:08.630 --> 15:10.420
hang it in the southern corner of the house

15:10.630 --> 15:11.610
to dry,

15:12.000 --> 15:13.220
then drizzle with sesame oil.

15:14.080 --> 15:15.650
It can then be used as filling.

15:16.200 --> 15:17.060
I thought

15:17.240 --> 15:19.100
tree roots were only eaten during times of famine.

15:19.550 --> 15:22.300
You eat to fill your tummy.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.010
I eat

15:24.870 --> 15:26.220
to cultivate.

15:26.750 --> 15:27.820
Cultivate?

15:28.480 --> 15:30.580
You guys should rest after finishing your meal.

15:31.000 --> 15:32.490
Be sure to rise at dawn with the rooster's call,

15:33.080 --> 15:34.100
cleanse yourself,

15:34.240 --> 15:35.340
and light incense in preparation.

15:38.360 --> 15:40.250
Get ready to learn the mantra.

15:47.200 --> 15:48.130
What kind of mantra is it?

15:48.550 --> 15:49.530
Why do we need to cleanse ourselves and light incense?

15:58.600 --> 16:01.180
You still have time to prepare bathwater and cook for them?

16:01.390 --> 16:02.460
Hurry and teach them the mantra.

16:02.630 --> 16:03.980
See if they have a spirit root.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.940
Don't get me blockheads again!

16:06.200 --> 16:08.100
Fine...

16:09.550 --> 16:09.980
Go away.

16:10.030 --> 16:11.490
Go away!

16:28.200 --> 16:28.890
Good morning, Physician Mo.

16:29.120 --> 16:29.980
Time to wake up.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.370
The sun's already high up in the sky.

16:31.840 --> 16:33.300
But we just finished cleaning ourselves up.

16:38.870 --> 16:40.180
The mantra

16:40.670 --> 16:42.220
is divided into several tiers.

16:42.550 --> 16:43.770
If you guys are able

16:44.630 --> 16:45.820
to master Tier 1

16:45.910 --> 16:47.650
in the next three months,

16:47.960 --> 16:50.610
then you may formally take me as your master.

16:51.150 --> 16:53.850
After that, you guys will receive the same monthly allowance as the rest

16:54.550 --> 16:56.100
of the members of Seven Mysteries Sect.

16:56.510 --> 16:57.580
There's actually money?

16:59.240 --> 17:00.580
I spent a lot of effort

17:00.670 --> 17:02.770
to procure this mantra.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.820
I won't let you guys off

17:04.870 --> 17:06.650
if you dare to tell anyone else about it.

17:06.720 --> 17:07.340
Understood?

17:07.960 --> 17:08.650
We won't tell anyone else about it!

17:08.750 --> 17:09.490
We'll never do that.

17:09.670 --> 17:10.580
Since you guys are illiterate,

17:10.750 --> 17:13.060
just repeat what I mantra.

17:13.670 --> 17:15.490
Attain ultimate emptiness.

17:15.960 --> 17:18.700
Attain ultimate empathy...

17:19.000 --> 17:20.530
This is driving me crazy.

17:21.630 --> 17:22.610
Emptiness!

17:23.270 --> 17:24.130
Emptiness.

17:24.150 --> 17:25.420
Keep this up, and I'll go crazy.

17:25.480 --> 17:26.010
My goodness.

17:26.960 --> 17:27.980
Maintain.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.370
Maintain.

17:29.670 --> 17:30.530
Profound.

17:30.750 --> 17:31.700
Profound.

17:31.840 --> 17:33.180
Tranquility.

17:34.240 --> 17:34.770
Tranquility?

17:34.910 --> 17:35.490
That's your tummy.

17:36.150 --> 17:36.850
It's tranquility.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.370
All things

17:39.510 --> 17:40.700
flourish.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.770
Flourish.

17:43.440 --> 17:46.370
And I watch their cycles of return.

17:46.480 --> 17:48.980
And I watch their cycles of return.

17:50.630 --> 17:52.300
Attain ultimate emptiness.

17:52.720 --> 17:54.460
Maintain profound tranquility...

17:54.460 --> 17:55.540
♪How many lives have suffered in vain♪

17:55.820 --> 17:56.940
♪A smile exchanged when we meet again♪

17:57.140 --> 17:58.380
♪No need to ask of the past or fate♪

17:58.660 --> 17:59.860
♪In a world so twisted, cruel, ornate♪

18:00.020 --> 18:01.220
♪I've always held my truth within♪

18:01.780 --> 18:02.620
♪Though you doubt where I begin♪

18:02.820 --> 18:04.340
♪From birth we're ranked♪

18:04.540 --> 18:05.620
♪A mortal frame, yet the path begun♪

18:05.780 --> 18:07.180
♪To knock upon the gate of gods♪

18:07.460 --> 18:08.620
♪Where schemes and danger come in floods♪

18:08.740 --> 18:09.980
♪Yet still unchanged♪

18:10.300 --> 18:11.020
♪Through all that's spun♪

18:11.220 --> 18:13.060
♪I look up. Stars, a thousand suns♪

18:13.460 --> 18:14.660
♪I ride the wind a thousand miles♪

18:14.740 --> 18:16.100
♪Mountains, rivers, none defile♪

18:16.700 --> 18:18.660
♪I roam the heavens far and wide♪

18:19.060 --> 18:20.500
♪Where flowers bloom and moons abide♪

18:20.700 --> 18:22.020
♪Through four seasons♪

18:22.660 --> 18:24.580
♪Life flows on♪

18:24.860 --> 18:26.380
♪Karma turns♪

18:26.580 --> 18:27.860
♪With each new dawn♪

18:28.860 --> 18:29.590
Master.

18:30.780 --> 18:32.220
♪If roads ahead are steep and long♪

18:32.460 --> 18:33.820
♪And foes ahead are fierce and strong♪

18:34.180 --> 18:36.340
♪Then turning back might just be wise♪

18:37.590 --> 18:38.860
Take off your belts.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.730
Take off your outer shirt.

18:54.830 --> 18:56.010
Show me how you circulate your energy.

19:06.590 --> 19:07.530
Useless.

19:12.880 --> 19:13.860
It's your turn.

19:21.110 --> 19:21.770
Why is his hand

19:22.240 --> 19:23.380
like a block of ice?

19:23.880 --> 19:24.900
It's like a dead man's hand.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.380
Attain ultimate emptiness.

19:27.830 --> 19:28.900
Maintain profound tranquility.

19:29.030 --> 19:30.140
All things flourish.

19:30.400 --> 19:31.530
And I watch their cycles of return.

19:35.790 --> 19:36.770
Attain ultimate emptiness.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.330
Maintain profound tranquility.

19:38.920 --> 19:40.010
All things flourish.

19:41.030 --> 19:42.180
And I watch their cycles of return.

19:47.880 --> 19:48.330
That hurts!

19:53.830 --> 19:55.050
- Be quiet. - That hurts!

19:55.200 --> 19:56.770
- That hurts! - Be quiet.

19:56.880 --> 19:57.730
Be quiet!

20:13.200 --> 20:14.660
This is great.

20:21.030 --> 20:23.220
I finally found someone who isn't a blockhead.

20:24.350 --> 20:25.330
This is great.

20:27.550 --> 20:29.660
Keep up this level of effort in the future too.

20:30.590 --> 20:31.660
From today onward,

20:33.310 --> 20:35.660
you are my direct disciple.

20:43.510 --> 20:45.530
Does that mean I can learn medicine

20:46.110 --> 20:47.090
and learn how to read and write?

20:47.540 --> 20:48.320
I'll teach you

20:49.550 --> 20:51.250
everything you want to know.

20:52.590 --> 20:53.490
I'll give you the best

20:55.310 --> 20:56.330
of everything.

21:11.510 --> 21:12.010
Master,

21:12.270 --> 21:13.940
Zhang Tie spent a lot of effort practicing the mantra as well.

21:15.640 --> 21:17.660
He's the same as all of the other blockheads.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.220
He's useless.

21:20.480 --> 21:21.490
He wakes up earlier

21:21.510 --> 21:22.460
and sleeps later than me.

21:22.750 --> 21:23.620
He never slacked off

21:23.920 --> 21:25.050
when it came to practicing the mantra.

21:25.550 --> 21:26.700
Please give him another chance.

21:27.510 --> 21:28.490
He cannot do it.

21:28.830 --> 21:31.250
Blockheads like him won't be enlightened

21:31.350 --> 21:32.530
even if you give him an eternity to practice it.

21:34.960 --> 21:35.670
Physician Mo,

21:35.920 --> 21:36.860
don't chase me away!

21:37.640 --> 21:38.490
I can endure hardships!

21:38.590 --> 21:39.770
I can do chores!

21:39.880 --> 21:40.240
I...

21:40.640 --> 21:41.730
I can grow crops!

21:41.750 --> 21:43.010
I can wash your feet on your behalf!

21:43.110 --> 21:43.900
I...

21:44.160 --> 21:45.770
I can also make flatbreads!

21:46.160 --> 21:47.250
Physician Mo, I'm begging you!

21:47.270 --> 21:48.380
Please don't chase me away!

21:51.720 --> 21:52.250
Master,

21:53.200 --> 21:54.530
if you're not willing to let Zhang Tie remain,

21:56.160 --> 21:57.250
I shall leave together with him.

21:58.270 --> 21:58.860
Zhang Tie.

22:13.440 --> 22:15.250
Let me see

22:15.400 --> 22:17.460
what else you can do.

22:41.070 --> 22:43.900
I do have a technique that's suitable for you.

22:44.720 --> 22:45.380
It's called

22:45.680 --> 22:47.050
Mammoth Skin.

22:49.270 --> 22:50.940
Even at the initial stage of mastery,

22:52.270 --> 22:53.940
you'll gain the power to move mountains.

22:54.160 --> 22:55.250
Is it that amazing? I'll do it!

22:56.750 --> 22:58.180
However, one has to endure what other people cannot

22:58.550 --> 23:01.050
in order to master the technique.

23:01.830 --> 23:02.730
Can you do it?

23:03.160 --> 23:03.730
I can endure

23:03.880 --> 23:04.700
all the hardships in the world

23:05.750 --> 23:06.700
as long as you don't chase me away.

23:10.000 --> 23:10.660
Excellent.

23:11.310 --> 23:12.090
Excellent.

23:13.880 --> 23:14.530
What about this?

23:14.750 --> 23:16.530
Both of you can remain here.

23:16.680 --> 23:17.810
Let me guide you two

23:17.830 --> 23:19.770
to the path of enlightenment.

23:21.640 --> 23:22.250
Thank you, Master.

23:22.270 --> 23:22.770
No.

23:22.790 --> 23:23.980
Get up.

23:24.640 --> 23:25.220
Listen.

23:26.270 --> 23:28.250
From now on, concentrate on cultivating the mantra.

23:29.290 --> 23:29.890
You have to

23:31.230 --> 23:33.140
monitor him all the time.

23:33.590 --> 23:35.380
Do not let him slack off.

23:38.510 --> 23:39.380
Go now.

23:40.440 --> 23:41.090
This is great.

23:41.440 --> 23:42.460
We can finally stay here.

23:50.000 --> 23:52.380
We're staying!

23:52.480 --> 23:56.460
We're staying!

24:04.030 --> 24:05.250
It's been so many years.

24:05.430 --> 24:06.920
We've finally found a mortal

24:07.030 --> 24:08.700
with a spirit root!

24:10.270 --> 24:11.180
Old Fool!

24:12.240 --> 24:13.220
Enough already.

24:13.240 --> 24:14.290
Stop talking.

24:15.270 --> 24:16.730
I need to prepare some prescriptions for him.

24:18.960 --> 24:19.290
This won't do.

24:19.680 --> 24:20.290
This won't do.

24:21.160 --> 24:22.330
You have to follow my prescriptions.

24:22.680 --> 24:23.620
Don't use these common goods.

24:24.310 --> 24:25.660
You and I cannot recover

24:25.880 --> 24:27.250
if you let this affect his cultivation progress.

24:27.440 --> 24:28.660
Enough already.

24:28.680 --> 24:29.460
That's enough!

24:31.110 --> 24:32.530
I know what to do.

24:39.790 --> 24:40.700
That smells great.

24:41.480 --> 24:42.460
Master, we're back.

24:47.480 --> 24:48.010
Master.

24:48.400 --> 24:49.140
What are you doing?

24:57.350 --> 24:58.220
Hurry and take off your clothes.

24:59.310 --> 25:00.140
I wasn't talking to you.

25:00.680 --> 25:01.220
Han Li.

25:01.720 --> 25:02.660
Hurry and take off your clothes.

25:03.480 --> 25:03.810
Come.

25:04.030 --> 25:04.570
Zhang Tie.

25:04.960 --> 25:05.730
Come and get some water with me.

25:05.830 --> 25:06.660
Yes, Master.

25:16.640 --> 25:17.490
How do you feel?

25:17.550 --> 25:18.290
This is

25:18.640 --> 25:20.700
the special herbal bath I've prepared for you.

25:21.920 --> 25:23.810
It's filled with precious herbs.

25:24.110 --> 25:25.380
You have to immerse yourself

25:25.590 --> 25:26.460
for four hours.

25:26.590 --> 25:27.940
Pay attention. It's four hours.

25:35.920 --> 25:36.940
How do you feel?

25:37.720 --> 25:38.730
Does your body feel unblocked and transparent?

25:43.640 --> 25:44.660
Maybe

25:44.880 --> 25:45.490
a little.

25:46.790 --> 25:47.860
Just a little?

25:50.510 --> 25:51.570
The herbs aren't strong enough.

25:51.750 --> 25:52.900
You stingy fool!

25:53.350 --> 25:54.900
You have to include more precious herbs.

25:55.270 --> 25:56.330
Don't be so stingy.

25:57.000 --> 25:57.490
Hurry!

25:57.680 --> 25:58.330
Hurry up!

25:58.480 --> 25:59.770
I've nearly given up all my treasured items

26:00.400 --> 26:02.220
just to aid this boy in his cultivation.

26:11.790 --> 26:12.980
Zhang Tie!

26:23.640 --> 26:24.980
Mix it slowly.

26:25.400 --> 26:26.180
Be careful with it!

26:29.240 --> 26:30.420
Sorry, Master.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.940
That's right.

26:36.510 --> 26:37.900
For the next four hours,

26:39.550 --> 26:43.250
regulate your breathing with the mantra I taught you.

26:45.440 --> 26:45.860
Come.

26:45.960 --> 26:47.180
Zhang Tie, keep an eye on it for me.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.770
Maintain

26:48.880 --> 26:49.570
the water temperature.

26:49.960 --> 26:51.220
Make sure it's not too high or too low.

26:59.350 --> 27:00.980
Attain ultimate emptiness.

27:19.040 --> 27:19.720
What's wrong?

27:21.050 --> 27:21.660
I can't take this.

27:21.920 --> 27:22.460
It's so hot.

27:22.920 --> 27:23.490
Master.

27:23.570 --> 27:24.150
Han Li.

27:24.150 --> 27:25.250
He's unwell.

27:29.880 --> 27:30.920
What's wrong?

27:30.920 --> 27:31.420
Master.

27:31.490 --> 27:32.660
Please take him out of the bathtub.

27:32.690 --> 27:33.620
Han Li!

27:33.880 --> 27:34.760
Come! Hurry!

27:35.000 --> 27:36.140
Don't move!

27:36.830 --> 27:38.380
Keep your composure!

27:38.790 --> 27:40.220
Good boy.

27:42.310 --> 27:42.980
How is it?

27:43.110 --> 27:44.180
How do you feel?

27:45.000 --> 27:46.010
It's so hot.

27:46.440 --> 27:47.380
It's so hot.

27:48.030 --> 27:49.050
It's very

27:49.400 --> 27:49.900
hot.

27:52.070 --> 27:52.770
That's more like it.

27:53.000 --> 27:54.140
Remember the mantra I taught you.

27:54.480 --> 27:55.660
Regulate your breathing slowly.

27:56.680 --> 27:57.220
Zhang Tie.

27:57.830 --> 27:58.290
Keep an eye on him.

27:59.110 --> 27:59.900
Give him a reminder.

28:01.480 --> 28:03.420
Attain ultimate emptiness.

28:05.240 --> 28:07.010
Maintain profound tranquility.

28:07.110 --> 28:07.810
Shut up.

28:09.110 --> 28:10.490
All things flourish.

28:10.510 --> 28:11.290
Shut up!

28:12.400 --> 28:13.140
Master, he...

28:14.720 --> 28:15.940
Recite the mantra.

28:17.510 --> 28:18.860
Attain ultimate emptiness.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.220
Attain ultimate emptiness.

28:20.310 --> 28:21.380
Maintain profound tranquility.

28:21.640 --> 28:22.900
Maintain...

28:23.110 --> 28:23.730
Maintain what?

28:23.880 --> 28:24.730
Maintain profound tranquility.

28:24.830 --> 28:25.900
Maintain profound tranquility!

28:26.030 --> 28:27.180
All things flourish.

28:28.000 --> 28:29.090
All things flourish!

28:29.110 --> 28:30.220
And I watch their cycles of return.

28:30.510 --> 28:31.570
And I watch their cycles of return.

28:31.590 --> 28:32.700
Attain ultimate emptiness.

28:33.480 --> 28:34.460
Attain ultimate emptiness.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.490
Maintain profound tranquility.

28:37.030 --> 28:37.810
Get down.

28:37.920 --> 28:38.420
Don't do this!

28:39.030 --> 28:39.980
Attain ultimate emptiness!

28:42.200 --> 28:43.140
Attain ultimate emptiness.

28:43.720 --> 28:44.730
Attain ultimate emptiness!

28:44.790 --> 28:45.620
Maintain profound tranquility!

28:45.830 --> 28:47.050
Maintain profound tranquility!

28:47.160 --> 28:48.140
All things flourish!

28:48.200 --> 28:49.380
All things flourish!

29:15.440 --> 29:15.980
Master!

29:16.070 --> 29:17.570
Master, what's wrong with Han Li?

29:17.830 --> 29:19.250
Blockhead, wake up!

29:19.480 --> 29:20.090
Blockhead!

29:20.160 --> 29:20.770
Master?

29:22.920 --> 29:24.180
Master, what's wrong with him?

29:27.830 --> 29:28.330
Master?

29:32.590 --> 29:33.330
Come.

29:58.110 --> 29:59.140
Blockhead, you're awake.

29:59.920 --> 30:01.050
You scared me, you know?

30:01.070 --> 30:02.900
I thought you were dead!

30:03.110 --> 30:04.460
Shut up!

30:05.720 --> 30:06.490
Master.

30:07.680 --> 30:08.770
What's wrong with me?

30:11.020 --> 30:13.530
You've mastered Tier 1.

30:14.510 --> 30:15.140
Blockhead.

30:15.480 --> 30:17.290
Master said you've mastered Tier 1.

30:17.960 --> 30:20.380
I suppose it'll only work with potent herbs.

30:23.200 --> 30:24.530
My dear boy.

30:25.830 --> 30:26.420
Come.

30:27.030 --> 30:27.660
Zhang Tie.

30:28.030 --> 30:29.700
Wipe his body with cold water.

30:30.220 --> 30:31.520
Take your time.

30:32.440 --> 30:34.840
Let me get some herbs that'll serve as your tonics.

30:34.910 --> 30:35.770
I'll brew it.

30:35.800 --> 30:37.180
And,

30:37.240 --> 30:38.290
I'm going to buy you

30:38.510 --> 30:39.730
some new clothes.

30:40.070 --> 30:41.250
New clothes?

30:41.720 --> 30:43.330
I've never worn new clothes before.

30:43.920 --> 30:45.290
I always wore my sister's used clothes.

30:45.550 --> 30:46.940
My second sister will wear my eldest sister's used clothes.

30:47.200 --> 30:48.330
[Longevity Art, Tier 1]
My third sister will do the same.

30:48.510 --> 30:50.460
After that, I'll wear the clothes made from their used ones.

30:56.270 --> 30:57.330
Unknowingly,

30:57.920 --> 30:59.770
it's already been over a year since we came to Shenshou Valley.

31:00.680 --> 31:01.250
In order

31:01.510 --> 31:02.460
to remain here,

31:02.960 --> 31:04.090
Zhang Tie has sacrificed a lot.

31:05.270 --> 31:06.490
To cultivate Mammoth Skin,

31:06.920 --> 31:08.620
one's body must be tempered countless times.

31:08.880 --> 31:09.940
He endured it all.

31:11.110 --> 31:12.620
Master didn't allow me to do chores such as gathering herbs

31:13.000 --> 31:14.460
or cooking.

31:14.880 --> 31:16.380
Zhang Tie had to do everything.

31:18.440 --> 31:19.530
Once we leave the mountain upon the mastery of our arts,

31:20.200 --> 31:20.700
I must

31:20.880 --> 31:21.730
treat him nicer.

31:23.030 --> 31:23.700
As for me,

31:24.400 --> 31:25.700
besides taking herbal brews, meditating,

31:26.000 --> 31:27.090
and cultivating the mantra,

31:27.640 --> 31:28.570
I have to take herbal baths

31:28.590 --> 31:30.730
that consist of precious herbs that I don't even know the name of.

31:31.680 --> 31:32.810
I don't know what the point is.

31:32.810 --> 31:34.240
[Heaven]

31:34.240 --> 31:34.810
However,

31:35.270 --> 31:36.730
Master also taught us how to read

31:37.240 --> 31:37.700
and write

31:38.640 --> 31:39.770
to open our minds to the gate of wisdom.

31:40.880 --> 31:41.770
So, this is what

31:42.510 --> 31:43.620
the sky looks like.

31:47.720 --> 31:48.530
All this while,

31:49.240 --> 31:50.090
Zhang Tie and I had saved up

31:50.790 --> 31:52.700
our monthly allowances and sent them back home.

31:53.640 --> 31:55.420
We also prepared a birthday present for Xiaomei.

31:57.030 --> 31:57.490
By the way,

31:58.240 --> 31:59.460
we also returned the white flour

32:00.000 --> 32:01.050
we borrowed from our neighbors.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.010
In the future, Father and Mother

32:03.480 --> 32:05.050
won't need to borrow anything from our neighbors again.

32:05.960 --> 32:06.730
We'll have all the buns and flatbreads

32:07.240 --> 32:08.050
in the world.

32:09.500 --> 32:15.940
♪And last eternally♪

32:20.240 --> 32:21.900
Although Master didn't want me to do chores,

32:22.750 --> 32:23.810
whenever I was free,

32:24.310 --> 32:25.460
I would gather herbs

32:25.640 --> 32:26.770
from the forest nearby.

32:27.880 --> 32:28.860
I did it to prepare myself

32:29.070 --> 32:30.420
before I study medicine from him

32:30.680 --> 32:31.620
in the future.

32:44.310 --> 32:45.140
What the heck is this?

33:12.110 --> 33:13.090
What is this?

33:13.680 --> 33:14.660
It's so green.

33:28.350 --> 33:29.490
It's green, huh?

33:36.110 --> 33:37.330
It looks pretty exquisite.

33:38.110 --> 33:39.050
What's inside the vial?

33:40.960 --> 33:41.620
Why don't we check it out?

33:50.070 --> 33:50.490
Here you go.

33:52.350 --> 33:52.940
What do you mean by this?

33:53.200 --> 33:53.860
Chop it in half.

33:54.840 --> 33:55.380
Hand me the cleaver.

34:02.790 --> 34:03.620
Let me see.

34:04.030 --> 34:05.140
Let me take a look.

34:08.000 --> 34:09.490
This vial is kind of weird.

34:09.750 --> 34:10.770
We can't even crack it with a cleaver.

34:11.030 --> 34:11.530
Let's throw it away.

34:12.350 --> 34:12.940
Don't do it!

34:13.200 --> 34:14.530
Let's save it.

34:15.920 --> 34:16.620
Fine, then.

34:27.180 --> 34:30.180
[Two Years Later]

34:31.440 --> 34:32.180
Master.

34:32.510 --> 34:33.420
Time to eat.

34:38.680 --> 34:39.250
Master.

34:40.640 --> 34:41.460
Han Li!

34:41.550 --> 34:42.770
Time to eat!

34:44.350 --> 34:44.980
Han Li!

34:45.680 --> 34:46.090
Coming!

34:46.110 --> 34:47.460
I made them according to your recipes.

34:48.310 --> 34:49.730
There's duck, fish, and braised meat.

34:50.160 --> 34:50.900
Excellent.

34:51.310 --> 34:52.570
Come.

34:54.440 --> 34:54.940
Make some space.

34:57.790 --> 34:58.220
Come.

34:58.240 --> 34:59.180
Put the braised meat here.

35:10.310 --> 35:11.490
Here.

35:18.960 --> 35:19.330
Han Li.

35:19.550 --> 35:20.010
Here you go.

35:20.400 --> 35:20.770
Have some duck.

35:30.270 --> 35:30.770
Here.

35:37.270 --> 35:37.940
Han Li!

35:39.000 --> 35:39.700
Han Li?

35:43.760 --> 35:44.690
Why are you here?

35:44.840 --> 35:45.740
Get back inside!

35:49.190 --> 35:49.780
What?

35:50.510 --> 35:51.090
What's wrong?

35:57.000 --> 35:57.740
You fool!

35:58.190 --> 36:00.340
What must cultivators avoid above all else?

36:00.880 --> 36:02.260
They must avoid

36:02.280 --> 36:04.420
impure food like meat and liquor.

36:05.320 --> 36:06.010
That means

36:06.670 --> 36:07.650
the boy

36:08.000 --> 36:11.090
has reached Tier 2!

36:13.510 --> 36:15.420
Tier 2?

36:16.000 --> 36:18.130
He has set foot on the immortal path!

36:20.760 --> 36:21.900
Really?

36:23.150 --> 36:23.940
From now on,

36:24.510 --> 36:26.940
he'll be entirely different

36:27.280 --> 36:30.260
from mere mortals like you all!

36:46.480 --> 36:47.420
This year,

36:47.880 --> 36:48.780
I reached Tier 2

36:48.880 --> 36:49.860
of my mantra cultivation.

36:51.440 --> 36:52.780
Master kept his promise.

36:53.150 --> 36:54.170
He taught me medicine.

36:56.280 --> 36:56.900
Medicine refinement,

36:57.550 --> 36:58.170
herb preparation,

36:58.800 --> 36:59.490
acupuncture,

37:00.230 --> 37:01.820
he taught me everything without reservation.

37:02.800 --> 37:03.530
Right now,

37:04.190 --> 37:05.530
even my monthly allowance

37:05.880 --> 37:07.460
has more than doubled.

37:09.320 --> 37:09.900
I wonder

37:10.070 --> 37:11.340
how everyone in the village is doing.

37:12.510 --> 37:13.090
Father.

37:13.840 --> 37:14.420
Mother.

37:15.190 --> 37:15.740
Xiaomei.

37:16.360 --> 37:17.090
I'm doing well

37:17.440 --> 37:18.260
over here.

37:19.510 --> 37:20.460
You guys don't need to worry about me.

37:23.510 --> 37:25.340
Apart from taking care of our daily meals and needs,

37:26.000 --> 37:26.940
Zhang Tie spent the rest of his time

37:27.320 --> 37:28.130
practicing

37:28.150 --> 37:29.570
the technique called Mammoth Skin,

37:29.760 --> 37:30.650
which Master has imparted to him.

37:31.550 --> 37:32.940
I don't see any bronze muscles or iron bones.

37:33.440 --> 37:34.380
Being covered in cuts and bruises

37:34.550 --> 37:35.740
became the norm instead.

37:37.150 --> 37:38.210
Using the medicinal skills I've learned,

37:38.360 --> 37:39.490
I created medicines to heal his injuries.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.210
At least I can finally help

37:41.440 --> 37:42.940
to relieve some of his pain.

37:46.710 --> 37:47.780
After reaching Tier 2,

37:48.670 --> 37:50.090
I realize that my vision had improved.

37:50.630 --> 37:51.570
My hearing has improved as well.

37:52.320 --> 37:54.170
My mind has become a bit sharper too.

37:55.190 --> 37:55.780
Seems like

37:56.320 --> 37:58.300
there's something magical about the mantra indeed.

38:00.760 --> 38:01.420
Back then,

38:02.320 --> 38:03.780
Li Feiyu, who led us into the sect,

38:04.550 --> 38:05.260
also known as Senior Li,

38:06.070 --> 38:07.130
was also promoted from an ordinary steward

38:08.000 --> 38:09.820
to the Deputy Hall Master of Outer Blade Hall.

38:10.670 --> 38:12.210
He deals with the villainous and wicked bandit gang

38:13.030 --> 38:13.780
called Wild Wolves Gang.

38:15.630 --> 38:16.980
I was once envious of him.

38:17.630 --> 38:18.900
I wanted to be like him.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.490
I wanted to be a martial arts expert

38:21.150 --> 38:22.340
and a pugilist.

38:23.030 --> 38:24.170
I wanted to roam the world,

38:24.710 --> 38:25.690
take revenge, and repay gratitude swiftly.

38:27.840 --> 38:28.490
It's a shame

38:29.070 --> 38:30.460
that there are no "what ifs" in life.

38:31.400 --> 38:33.260
I could only practice and take herbal brews

38:33.800 --> 38:34.460
day after day.

38:35.480 --> 38:36.460
Unknowingly,

38:37.400 --> 38:39.900
it seems that thought has already faded away.

39:00.800 --> 39:01.170
Scram!

39:09.360 --> 39:11.210
Tell the entire Wild Wolves Gang

39:11.710 --> 39:13.980
that none of you better think of stepping into Seven Mysteries Sect.

39:15.230 --> 39:16.050
If not,

39:17.960 --> 39:18.900
you will end up like this.

39:21.000 --> 39:21.610
Let's go!

39:32.030 --> 39:32.570
Master.

39:32.840 --> 39:33.860
[Two and a Half Years Later]
Look at the gardenia plants.

39:34.230 --> 39:35.050
They're growing so well.

39:35.880 --> 39:37.260
If we boil them

39:37.670 --> 39:40.740
and mix it with powdered licorice root to make Duanmu tofu,

39:40.800 --> 39:42.530
it'll turn into an exquisite vegetarian dish.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.820
Child, plants are not the only edible food around here.

39:48.110 --> 39:49.170
Within this boundless world,

39:49.440 --> 39:50.690
even stone and sand,

39:51.230 --> 39:52.460
dew at dawn and glow at dusk,

39:53.070 --> 39:55.090
all may serve as sustenance.

39:55.710 --> 39:56.460
Lately,

39:57.590 --> 39:58.820
I've been wondering about

39:59.110 --> 40:00.050
the mantra you taught me.

40:02.510 --> 40:03.340
Tell me what's on your mind.

40:04.230 --> 40:05.170
Attain ultimate emptiness.

40:05.760 --> 40:06.460
Maintain profound tranquility.

40:07.230 --> 40:08.340
Maybe it's because

40:08.590 --> 40:10.900
nothing is perfect in the world.

40:12.800 --> 40:13.980
Due to the imperfection,

40:14.630 --> 40:16.420
mortals feel empty and lost.

40:18.110 --> 40:19.690
Only by accepting such emptiness

40:21.000 --> 40:22.690
will we be able to find tranquility.

40:30.320 --> 40:31.460
Did I say something wrong?

40:33.880 --> 40:35.130
From now on, you're only allowed to gather herbs.

40:37.280 --> 40:38.130
Do not read

40:38.150 --> 40:39.420
any books again.

40:40.480 --> 40:41.170
But why?

40:43.710 --> 40:44.650
Your cultivation progress

40:44.760 --> 40:45.940
has been lagging behind for the past few months.

40:46.670 --> 40:48.340
You have to focus on your cultivation.

40:48.670 --> 40:49.940
Anything else other than that

40:50.280 --> 40:51.570
has nothing to do with you.

41:05.000 --> 41:06.490
It's all your fault!

41:07.360 --> 41:09.650
Who told you to let him read books?

41:10.320 --> 41:12.090
Now, he has formed his own thoughts.

41:12.440 --> 41:13.610
How can we control him like this?

41:13.630 --> 41:14.420
Shut up!

41:15.670 --> 41:17.490
Did you think he'd stay in the valley

41:17.920 --> 41:19.650
and do his cultivation training

41:19.670 --> 41:21.650
had I not lured him with the teaching of medicine?

41:26.880 --> 41:28.940
You're a pathetic excuse for an immortal.

41:29.550 --> 41:32.130
You only nag people non-stop.

41:34.670 --> 41:35.980
If you're that free,

41:36.000 --> 41:38.260
you should keep a close eye on that child.

41:48.190 --> 41:49.860
Master kept all of his books away.

41:50.510 --> 41:51.300
He swapped them into herbs.

41:55.070 --> 41:55.820
Why did Master's moods

41:56.510 --> 41:58.050
shift so unpredictably?

41:58.960 --> 42:00.460
It's as if he has suddenly turned into a different person.

42:01.280 --> 42:02.530
I have to be careful in the future.

42:03.280 --> 42:05.610
I mustn't tell people what's on my mind easily.

42:28.150 --> 42:29.820
I've never encountered such a situation

42:30.480 --> 42:32.210
ever since I reached Tier 2 of cultivation.

42:32.880 --> 42:33.940
I have the feeling

42:34.510 --> 42:36.340
that something bad is about to happen.

42:38.710 --> 42:39.420
What is this?

42:47.960 --> 42:48.980
This vial,

42:49.960 --> 42:50.980
why is it glowing?

42:57.920 --> 42:59.460
It can absorb moonlight?

43:20.190 --> 43:21.940
Seems like my hypothesis was correct.

43:22.880 --> 43:23.860
The closed door and windows

43:24.000 --> 43:25.820
were obstructing the vial from absorbing the light rays.

43:27.030 --> 43:28.690
The vial can absorb light rays better

43:29.190 --> 43:31.130
at spacious areas with open space.

43:31.480 --> 43:32.860
Only then

43:32.960 --> 43:33.740
will the light orb be larger.

43:35.030 --> 43:36.090
Although I don't know

43:36.280 --> 43:37.740
where the light rays are coming from

43:38.510 --> 43:40.050
or what the vial is doing

43:40.280 --> 43:41.300
when it absorbs the light rays,

43:42.230 --> 43:43.530
I suppose I'm getting much closer

43:43.840 --> 43:45.130
to solving the riddle.

43:46.630 --> 43:48.530
But why can't I open it?

43:59.630 --> 44:00.570
Why are you only here now?

44:00.880 --> 44:02.050
Weren't we supposed to meet on the third quarter of the Hour of Yin?

44:03.150 --> 44:04.690
Li Feiyu was doing his rounds tonight.

44:05.000 --> 44:06.210
I'm lucky that I'm able to be here.

44:06.800 --> 44:07.690
Is that a member of Wild Wolves Gang

44:07.840 --> 44:09.090
and a member of Seven Mysteries Sect?

44:09.840 --> 44:10.780
Any word

44:10.880 --> 44:11.820
on that cargo?

44:12.960 --> 44:13.530
Of course.

44:14.150 --> 44:16.380
This is a birthday gift for King Qin.

44:16.550 --> 44:18.050
He's actually in cahoots with Wild Wolves Gang.

44:18.320 --> 44:19.300
He has betrayed Seven Mysteries Sect.

44:20.030 --> 44:21.090
I have to hurry back and report this to them.

44:21.360 --> 44:22.260
We'll depart in three days.

44:23.190 --> 44:24.130
How much can we rob from them this time?

44:24.360 --> 44:24.820
Who's there?

44:30.280 --> 44:31.010
You should return first.

44:31.480 --> 44:32.570
[Wu Yan, Disciple of Seven Mysteries Sect]
Don't let people see us together.

44:33.000 --> 44:33.460
I'll go after him.

44:45.480 --> 44:46.860
You run pretty fast even though you don't know martial arts.

45:01.110 --> 45:01.650
Master?

45:05.190 --> 45:07.130
I told you to focus on your cultivation in the valley.

45:07.920 --> 45:09.940
Why did you get into a fight?

45:10.110 --> 45:10.690
Master.

45:11.320 --> 45:12.650
I couldn't sleep last night.

45:12.800 --> 45:13.690
I went to the forest to meditate.

45:14.110 --> 45:14.940
I heard about his collusion

45:15.440 --> 45:16.780
with Wild Wolves Gang by accident.

45:16.920 --> 45:17.780
He has betrayed our sect!

45:18.070 --> 45:19.010
Our sect?

45:19.760 --> 45:20.780
Wild Wolves Gang?

45:20.880 --> 45:22.260
The mortals can fight and betray each other all they like.

45:22.280 --> 45:23.340
That's none of your business.

45:24.150 --> 45:25.780
Do you know that your life

45:26.000 --> 45:28.340
is more precious than the entire Seven Mysteries Sect?

45:38.510 --> 45:40.380
I won't let anyone

45:40.840 --> 45:42.340
harm you.

45:44.030 --> 45:45.090
He's a mole.

45:45.190 --> 45:47.570
Did you not hear me the first time?

45:51.150 --> 45:52.210
Go back and focus on your cultivation.

45:53.070 --> 45:55.050
Reach Tier 3 as soon as possible.

46:01.150 --> 46:02.650
You scoundrels

46:02.670 --> 46:05.340
have never shown me any respect.

46:06.000 --> 46:07.050
What?

46:07.070 --> 46:09.740
Do you think I'm old, deaf, and blind?

46:10.880 --> 46:12.980
Do you know who his life belongs to?

46:15.760 --> 46:16.820
No one

46:18.000 --> 46:20.090
is to lay a finger on him except for me.

46:39.630 --> 46:40.090
Han Li!

46:40.230 --> 46:40.820
Something bad has happened!

46:41.030 --> 46:42.010
A member of Seven Mysteries Sect

46:42.190 --> 46:43.210
fell off the valley!

46:45.760 --> 46:46.570
Master killed him.

46:51.880 --> 46:52.530
Master...

46:58.550 --> 46:59.420
Master?

46:59.920 --> 47:00.570
That can't be.

47:03.190 --> 47:04.490
Master just killed someone!

47:06.400 --> 47:07.050
Master,

47:07.710 --> 47:08.530
he killed someone?

47:21.670 --> 47:22.460
Master

47:23.190 --> 47:25.050
is actually a hidden martial arts expert.

47:26.320 --> 47:28.300
Why has he never shown his skills in front of us?

47:29.400 --> 47:30.780
Did he hide it from us deliberately?

47:31.840 --> 47:32.690
Or...

47:42.710 --> 47:44.340
How can you cultivate in peace

47:45.710 --> 47:47.530
when your heart is so restless?

47:48.800 --> 47:50.900
You've been slacking off too much lately.

47:53.150 --> 47:54.420
It's pouring out there.

47:54.510 --> 47:56.010
Sleep early.

47:56.630 --> 47:57.900
Once the weather turns better,

47:57.960 --> 48:00.340
I'll descend the mountain to seek medicine for you.

48:01.670 --> 48:02.530
Remember.

48:04.880 --> 48:05.860
I'll always

48:06.000 --> 48:07.860
keep an eye on you.

48:42.580 --> 48:47.900
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

48:49.220 --> 48:54.620
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

48:54.740 --> 48:57.940
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

48:58.180 --> 49:00.420
♪Old scenes rise again♪

49:00.820 --> 49:03.660
♪Too hard to forget♪

49:04.180 --> 49:08.140
♪Easier just to miss♪

49:08.980 --> 49:14.460
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

49:15.620 --> 49:20.900
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

49:21.500 --> 49:24.540
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

49:24.820 --> 49:26.940
♪Swept away by time♪

49:27.580 --> 49:30.220
♪Eyes once looked far♪

49:30.700 --> 49:34.660
♪Now lost in the shift♪

49:35.140 --> 49:37.980
♪Autumn winds stir♪

49:38.260 --> 49:40.180
♪Smoke curls once more♪

49:40.620 --> 49:43.060
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

49:43.380 --> 49:46.900
♪Returning to my eyes♪

49:47.460 --> 49:50.420
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

49:50.740 --> 49:53.660
♪Time lost its name♪

49:54.060 --> 49:56.900
♪Was it yesterday♪

49:57.300 --> 50:00.860
♪Or tomorrow?♪

50:01.220 --> 50:04.060
♪The world has changed♪

50:04.460 --> 50:06.300
♪Beyond recall♪

50:06.860 --> 50:08.580
♪Time will fade♪

50:08.980 --> 50:13.780
♪All the words ever spoken♪

50:14.460 --> 50:17.340
♪Only this longing remains♪

50:17.820 --> 50:23.100
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

50:24.220 --> 50:30.860
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

50:31.340 --> 50:41.060
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
